<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson results by geographical area.</title>
<headline>Ericsson results by geographical area.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB on Tuesday posted a 33 percent rise in pre-tax profits for 1996 with a result of 10.15 billion crowns and a 26 percent lift in turnover to 124.27 billion crowns.</p>
<p>Following is a break down of Ericsson's sales by geographical area.</p>
<p> SALES BY GEOGRAPHIC AREA (million skr) 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Sweden					  7,616   vs   9,043</p>
<p> Europe (excl Sweden)		     48,098   vs  40,806</p>
<p> U.S. and Canada			    15,729   vs  11,154</p>
<p> Latin America				12,047   vs   6,830</p>
<p> Africa					  2,379   vs   1,945</p>
<p> Asia					   28,896   vs  19,804</p>
<p> Middle East				   3,941   vs   3,381</p>
<p> Oceania					 5,560   vs   5,817</p>
<p> TOTAL					 124,266   vs  98,780</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
